## Directory Architecture (`G:\My Drive\!cosplaydad3d`)
1. **`01_Inbox_Drop/`** — Drop zone for raw photos, videos, AI paint concepts, 4-pose sheets, `.stl`s, `.blend`s, and `.3mf` files.
2. **`02_Ready_To_Post/`** — Active Instagram/Social batches (`Batch_XX_...`).
3. **`03_Posted_Archive/`** — Archived social batches (`Batch_XX_...`) with recorded posted dates and platforms (`Instagram Only`, `MakerWorld Only`, or `Both`).
4. **`04_MakerWorld_Models/`** — Dedicated 7-Stage Product Library for original 3D printable designs (`MW_01_EmberCore_...`):
   - `01_4Pose_Turnarounds/` — Orthographic 4-view images uploaded to Tripo AI.
   - `02_Paint_And_Finish_Concepts/` — AI-generated paint-job styling, colorways, lighting mockups, and concept videos.
   - `03_Tripo_Raw_90MB/` — Raw ~90MB high-density `.stl` / `.glb` straight from Tripo (`> 500,000` triangles — never upload to MakerWorld).
   - `04_Blender_Working/` — Both `.blend` files (`Sculpted_HighPoly.blend` and `Decimated_500k.blend`).
   - `05_Final_STL_Under500k/` — ✅ **UPLOAD THIS STL**: Decimated (`200k–350k` target, `<500k` max) `EmberCore_*_v1.stl`.
   - `06_Bambu_3MF_Profile/` — ✅ **UPLOAD THIS 3MF**: Sliced Bambu Studio `EmberCore_*_Profile.3mf`.
   - `07_Real_Print_Photos/` — ✅ **UPLOAD THESE PICS**: Physical print Cover Image + Blender MatCap clay render.
   - `MODEL_LISTING.md` — Ready-to-copy MakerWorld Title, Tags, Checklist & Description.
5. **`05_Concept_Vault_And_Lookbooks/`** — Bulk organizer for AI concept art, paint-job lookbooks, and video ideas (`01_Unsorted_Concept_Drop/`, `02_EmberCore_Paint_And_Glow_Concepts/`, `03_Weapon_And_Prop_Concepts/`, `04_4Pose_Character_Sheets/`).
6. **`99_Raw_Originals_Backup/`** — Permanent `.jpg` and video backup (plus `_Vetoed_Archive/`).

